cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
title: "Hugging Face Adoption History (wss-hugging-face)"
abstract: >-
  Point-in-time capture of Hugging Face Hub model adoption metrics
  (downloads, likes) for the text-generation ecosystem. The public API
  exposes only rolling windows and running totals; this archive preserves
  the history the source destroys, with an append-only manifest as the
  provenance record.
authors:
  - name: "neldivad"
    website: "https://github.com/neldivad"
  - name: "q3dresearch"
    website: "https://github.com/q3dresearch"
# No `license:` field: Hub metadata under platform ToS, and each model carries its uploader's own licence
# The CODE is MIT (see LICENSE); this file cites the DATASET.
keywords:
  - git-scraping
  - open-data
  - point-in-time-data
  - dataset
  - hugging-face
